- acquire_protein_structure [preprocess]: Download and prepare a protein structure when no PDB file is provided.  Parses UniProt ID, protein name, domain label, and residue range from the user request, downloads from AlphaFold DB (or RCSB fallback), optionally extracts a domain (e.g. kinase domain resid 503-771), and va…
